{
  "id": "soil_and_rock___bulk_factors",
  "title": "Soil and Rock - Bulk Factors",
  "description": "Soil and rock expansion - or swell - after mining. One cubic meter from the borrow expands when dropped on the lorry or landfill, translating borrow volume to dump volume using bulking factors.",
